_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [[DB-438]](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-438)\r\nTracker task for hardening tablet splitting. The current release timelines for turning tablet splitting on are\r\n- for latest releases, we will enable it starting in 2.11.0\r\n- for stable releases, we will enable it in some future version of 2.8.x\r\n\r\n# Known issues (timeline 2.8.x)\r\n✅ Very large txns (50k+) could be lost if splitting during apply phase (#10162)\r\n✅ Issues with manual splitting (#10347)\r\n✅ Issues with YSQL ALTER TABLE (#10351)\r\n⬜️ Log spew on intent cleanup if compactions take too long (#10154)\r\n\r\n# Production readiness (timeline 2.8.x)\r\n⬜️ Admin UI to monitor split progress (#8197)\r\n✅ Display split depth in master UI (#10435)\r\n✅ Factor in blacklist for full moves (#8198)\r\n✅ Threshold math should only work off of nodes in the table's placement (#8660)\r\n✅ Split selection algorithm should prioritize by tablet size (#10498)\r\n✅ Investigate if large txn apply records could affect computing split key (#10163)\r\n✅ Disable splitting during backups to prevent transient failures (#8744)\r\n\r\n# Interactions with other features\r\n## Supported features\r\nThese features are well integrated with tablet splitting.\r\n\r\n✅ PITR (#8235)\r\n✅ Index backfill (#6704) -- If a split is in progress, backfill fails. If backfill is in progress, splitting does not get triggered.\r\n✅ Backup restore for YCQL (#6628) and YSQL(#8229)\r\n✅ Geo-partition -- should just work, as partitions are just normal YB tables under the hood\r\n\r\n## Disabled features\r\nTablet splitting is not currently supported for the following and thus sensibly disabled. The behavior would thus be that you can use the respective feature, but tables related to it would not get automatically split.\r\n\r\n✅ YEDIS (#8255)\r\n✅ xcluster replication (#8256)\r\n✅ System transactions table\r\n\r\n## Support (timeline 2.11.x)\r\nThese features do not yet have support for splitting, but we are actively working towards them.\r\n⬜️ xcluster replication (#5373)\r\n⬜️ TTL file expiry (#10515)\r\n⬜️ colocation (#4396)\n\n[DB-438]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-438?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/8242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/8242/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4745931796,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQ3NDU5MzE3OTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/4745931796","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"8025ea6dd8cfb79a7556501b410650c635cadbf8","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits/8025ea6dd8cfb79a7556501b410650c635cadbf8","created_at":"2021-05-14T08:48:36Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":4745932510,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50NDc0NTkzMjUxMA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/4745932510","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https